[{"ave_id":"AVE-2013-0006","file_name":"2013/AVE-2013-0006.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2013-2621","title":"Telaen 开放重定向漏洞","description":"Telaen 是一款开源 Webmail 应用程序，其 redir.php 脚本中存在开放重定向漏洞。攻击者可构造特制 URL，诱使已登录用户点击后将其重定向至任意外部恶意网站，进而实施钓鱼攻击或窃取用户凭证。该漏洞影响 Telaen 1.3.1 之前的所有版本，攻击无需身份认证，仅需用户交互即可利用，CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2013-2621"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2020-02-03T15:15:11Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:53:43Z","remediation":"升级 Telaen 至 1.3.1 或更高版本，该版本已修复 redir.php 的重定向校验逻辑。如无法升级，可修改 redir.php 对 `url` 参数实施白名单验证，仅允许跳转到可信域名，或直接禁用该文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/60290","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/84683","https://www.isecauditors.com/advisories-2013#2013-009","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/38546","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2013/CVE-2013-2621.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2013/CVE-2013-2621.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/efa56541ba84ae91eb0da267c473426b115491e2/http/cves/2013/CVE-2013-2621.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/21e8713bd16ad152d6b946e7bfcd11df673c4829/cves/2013/2xxx/CVE-2013-2621.json","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2013-2621_2.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03de0f4bc3d6ed449f7108b4761b99fb0c8c56d7/CVE/data/2013/CVE-2013-2621.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/12b17c3a920977c39623bf81e990cc5fbcf1c02c/2013/CVE-2013-2621.json","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2013-2621_46.yaml","https://github.com/RiskBasedPrioritization/RiskBasedPrioritizationAnalysis/blob/3d5cc1819ecb8cbc3aeb75d9a8260318544faf56/data_in/nuclei/nuclei.txt","https://github.com/Bmcbob76/prometheus-prime/blob/952c957f0c453e1048be9399b27309a12965e432/NUCLEI_TEMPLATES/http/cves/2013/CVE-2013-2621.yaml","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2013/CVE-2013-2621"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2013/AVE-2013-0006.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2013-0011","file_name":"2013/AVE-2013-0011.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2013-4982","title":"AVTECH AVN801 DVR 安全绕过漏洞","description":"AVTECH AVN801 DVR 存在安全绕过漏洞，攻击者可通过绕过管理员登录验证码(CAPTCHA)机制，在无需合法凭据的情况下直接访问设备管理后台。该漏洞源于登录模块对验证码的验证逻辑存在缺陷，允许远程攻击者通过网络请求实现对设备管理权限的未授权获取。CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。受影响设备多用于安防监控领域，一旦被利用可导致视频监控系统被完全控制、敏感视频数据泄露等严重后果。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2013-4982"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-12-27T17:15:15Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:58:12Z","remediation":"AVTECH 官方未针对此漏洞发布固件更新，该设备已停止支持。建议立即将设备从公网断开，仅在内网使用，并在防火墙层面限制对 80/554 端口的访问来源 IP。如业务允许，应更换为受支持的 DVR 设备，并禁用远程管理功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2013/Aug/284","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/62035","https://www.coresecurity.com/advisories/avtech-dvr-multiple-vulnerabilities","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/27942","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2013/CVE-2013-4982.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2013/CVE-2013-4982.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/efa56541ba84ae91eb0da267c473426b115491e2/http/cves/2013/CVE-2013-4982.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/5c4b2ba2a59a96457ab4b8ea4ee82efc5782bb1d/cves/2013/4xxx/CVE-2013-4982.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2013/CVE-2013-4982","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03de0f4bc3d6ed449f7108b4761b99fb0c8c56d7/CVE/data/2013/CVE-2013-4982.json","https://github.com/youki992/VscanPlus/blob/714a0e276a538a22c1a6215c71458a8b59a920ef/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/http/cves/2013/CVE-2013-4982.yaml","https://github.com/1979139113/0day-today-exploits/blob/8b2194688e3c722fe9369b045e37382e7f45e12b/21179.txt","https://github.com/ryanmrestivo/red-team/blob/1e53b7aa77717a22c9bd54facc64155a9a4c49fc/_Resources/Exploit%20DB%202021-12-11/exploits/hardware/dos/27942.txt","https://github.com/Yuning-J/NVDFeatureAnalysis/blob/493a57a415cc110f9945148abd717eeb92f6ca7e/originalDataset/cveIDThreatType/cve_idbypass","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2013-4982_11.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2013/AVE-2013-0011.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2013-0017","file_name":"2013/AVE-2013-0017.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2013-7285","title":"Xstream API 不安全的XML反序列化远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Xstream API 版本 1.4.6 及之前版本、1.4.10 版本中存在不安全的 XML 反序列化漏洞。如果安全框架未初始化，远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的 XML 或 JSON 数据流触发该漏洞，在目标服务器上执行任意系统命令。该漏洞影响广泛使用 Xstream 组件的 Java 应用，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。建议用户初始化安全框架或升级至修复版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2013-7285"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-05-15T17:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:01:39Z","remediation":"升级到 Xstream 1.4.10 或更高版本，并在初始化时调用 `XStream.setupDefaultSecurity()` 启用安全框架，以限制反序列化类白名单。如无法升级，可在应用层对 XML 输入进行白名单校验，禁止反序列化危险类。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://blog.diniscruz.com/2013/12/xstream-remote-code-execution-exploit.html","http://seclists.org/oss-sec/2014/q1/69","http://web.archive.org/web/20140204133306/http://blog.diniscruz.com/2013/12/xstream-remote-code-execution-exploit.html","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/6d3d34adcf3dfc48e36342aa1f18ce3c20bb8e4c458a97508d5bfed1%40%3Cissues.activemq.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/dcf8599b80e43a6b60482607adb76c64672772dc2d9209ae2170f369%40%3Cissues.activemq.apache.org%3E","https://www.mail-archive.com/user%40xstream.codehaus.org/msg00604.html","https://www.mail-archive.com/user%40xstream.codehaus.org/msg00607.html","https://www.oracle.com/security-alerts/cpuoct2020.html","https://x-stream.github.io/CVE-2013-7285.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/39193","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2013/CVE-2013-7285.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2013/CVE-2013-7285.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/c2df87babf8eed88f612cb73e25ef1a25c924358/2013/CVE-2013-7285.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/efa56541ba84ae91eb0da267c473426b115491e2/http/cves/2013/CVE-2013-7285.yaml","https://github.com/chushuai/wscan/blob/d154617a1da7302d292d7c3cce9dce39d85ddb0c/core/plugins/xstream/CVE-2013-7285.go","https://github.com/x-stream/xstream/blob/a0f1637e977e6f682f483873b5877e6fe18247b8/xstream-distribution/src/content/CVE-2013-7285.html","https://github.com/apache/jmeter/blob/ad6ecbd175a1bc24dae56e999d10f020c0c80a42/THREAT_MODEL.md","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/aaad87cd4808a501b9c27168b0278466591227b9/data/2013/CVE-2013-7285-shoucheng3_x-stream__xstream_CVE-2013-7285_1-4-6.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2013/CVE-2013-7285","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/fd5a60b9d722f22d25e3006c20222fbaba7000b5/osv/cve/2013/UBUNTU-CVE-2013-7285.json","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2013-7285_5.yaml","https://github.com/shoucheng3/x-stream__xstream_CVE-2013-7285_1-4-6"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2013/POC-AVE-2013-0017.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2013/EXP-AVE-2013-0017.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2013/AVE-2013-0017.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2013-0019","file_name":"2013/AVE-2013-0019.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2013-2597","title":"Qualcomm MSM设备acdb音频驱动堆栈缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Code Aurora 贡献的 Qualcomm MSM 设备 Android 内核 acdb 音频驱动中，audio_acdb.c 文件的 acdb_ioctl() 函数存在栈缓冲区溢出漏洞。攻击者通过具有 /dev/msm_acdb 设备访问权限的恶意应用，在 ioctl 调用参数中传入过大的 size 值触发栈溢出，可导致内核态权限提升。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核 2.6.x 及 3.x 系列版本，CVSS 评分 8.4，危害等级高，已被 CISA KEV 收录，存在在野利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.4,"aliases":["CVE-2013-2597"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2014-08-31T10:55:03Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:53:41Z","remediation":"立即安装设备厂商提供的最新 Android 安全更新（2013 年后的 Qualcomm MSM 设备补丁已包含修复）。对于运行自定义 ROM 或 AOSP 编译环境的用户，需将内核升级至包含 acdb_ioctl 函数中 ioctl 参数大小校验补丁的版本（在 audio_acdb.c 中增加对用户传入 size 值的边界检查，确保不超过栈缓冲区长度），或从 Code Aurora Forum (CAF) 对应内核分支 cherry-pick 相关修复 commit。如无法立即更新，可通过限制 /dev/msm_acdb 设备节点的访问权限（仅允许系统级音频服务进程访问，禁止第三方应用直接操作）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.codeaurora.org/projects/security-advisories/stack-based-buffer-overflow-acdb-audio-driver-cve-2013-2597","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2013-2597","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2013/CVE-2013-2597.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/3c5116308718006831f8b0ac674f891f3d553471/2013/CVE-2013-2597.json","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/dc4a87067238e8e55e5d3f9777b54558310f6d6e/2013/CVE-2013-2597/README.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2013/CVE-2013-2597","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2013/2xxx/CVE-2013-2597.json","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2013-2597.html","https://github.com/diannaofengzi/POC/blob/14d504f7488db9229f6f02be54aab53e3cfee0dc/databases/2013/database/CVE-2013-2597/libmsm_acdb_exploit-fi01.md","https://github.com/lucacapacci/cisa_kev/blob/d206e936b7c9c49da608b2e68f805e3421c7432a/data_single/2013/CVE-2013-2597.csv","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2013/CVE-2013-2597.md","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2013-2597","https://github.com/fi01/libmsm_acdb_exploit"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2013/POC-AVE-2013-0019.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2013/EXP-AVE-2013-0019.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2013/AVE-2013-0019.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2013-0500","file_name":"2013/AVE-2013-0500.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2013-3993","title":"IBM InfoSphere BigInsights 路径遍历漏洞","description":"IBM InfoSphere BigInsights 2.1.0.3 之前版本中存在路径遍历漏洞（CWE-22）。远程认证用户可通过向未指定的 API 调用传递特制参数，绕过预期的文件和目录访问限制，进而读取服务器上的敏感文件或访问不受信任的数据与代码。攻击者需拥有有效用户凭证，利用难度较低，CVSS 评分 6.5，影响数据的机密性。IBM 已在 BigInsights 2.1.0.3 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2013-3993"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2014-07-07T11:01:28Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:56:08Z","remediation":"升级 IBM InfoSphere BigInsights 至 2.1.0.3 或更高版本，该版本已修复 API 参数校验缺陷，防止通过构造特殊参数绕过文件与目录访问限制。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理层对 /api/ 路径下的请求实施严格的输入白名单过滤，限制非必要的 API 调用参数类型与长度，并审计所有已认证用户的 API 访问日志以发现异常行为。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://secunia.com/advisories/59676","http://www-01.ibm.com/support/docview.wss?uid=swg21677445","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/68449","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/84982","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2013-3993","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2013/CVE-2013-3993.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2013/3xxx/CVE-2013-3993.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2013/CVE-2013-3993","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2013/3xxx/CVE-2013-3993.json","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2013-3993.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2013-3993.html","https://github.com/Ostorlab/KEV/blob/8feadeb8b7ff54359eab87941769781629146b23/README.md","https://github.com/lucacapacci/cisa_kev/blob/d206e936b7c9c49da608b2e68f805e3421c7432a/data_single/2013/CVE-2013-3993.csv","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-2qh2-hj3f-rhcf/GHSA-2qh2-hj3f-rhcf.json","https://github.com/KaweGG/vulnerability_tracker/blob/01de5763b71f6c005791d4aa8121132990782604/cves/CVE-2013-3993.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2013/AVE-2013-0500.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2013-0005","file_name":"2013/AVE-2013-0005.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2013-2287","title":"WordPress Uploader 插件跨站脚本漏洞","description":"WordPress 的 Roberta Bramski Uploader 插件 1.0.4 版本中 views/notify.php 文件存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向 notify 或 blog 参数注入恶意 Web 脚本或 HTML 代码，当管理员或其他用户访问受影响的页面时，注入的脚本将在浏览器中执行，可能导致敏感信息泄露或会话劫持。该漏洞无需身份认证即可利用，影响使用该插件的 WordPress 站点。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2013-2287"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2014-04-04T14:55:11Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:53:04Z","remediation":"立即停用并删除 Uploader 1.0.4 插件，该插件已长期无人维护且官方不再提供安全更新；建议替换为功能相近的活跃维护插件（如 WordPress Media Library Categories）。若必须临时使用，编辑 views/notify.php 文件，对 notify 和 blog 参数使用 esc_html() 或 wp_strip_all_tags() 进行输出编码过滤，同时在 Web 服务器（如 Nginx/Apache WAF）层面添加规则拦截包含 <script> 等恶意标签的请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://osvdb.org/90840","https://www.dognaedis.com/vulns/DGS-SEC-16.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/38355","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2013/CVE-2013-2287.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2013/CVE-2013-2287.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/efa56541ba84ae91eb0da267c473426b115491e2/http/cves/2013/CVE-2013-2287.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2013/CVE-2013-2287/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2013-2287.py","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder4/cve-2013-2287-2248.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2013-2287-2244.yaml","https://github.com/exploit-io/nuclei-templates/blob/a4b7182985a6e45df346cfe45242d40455e152b5/templates/cve-2013-2287-2247.yaml","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/6001-to-7000-templates/cve-2013-2287-2248.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v2/C/cve-2013-2287-2243.yaml","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2013/CVE-2013-2287.rules","https://github.com/coreruleset/seaweed-reports/blob/3e2a1bd3dbca1b431f18ed0dabb71fa729d4d059/2022/Sep/18/xssArtifact/xssReport.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2013/AVE-2013-0005.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2013-0555","file_name":"2013/AVE-2013-0555.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2013-7331","title":"Microsoft XMLDOM ActiveX 控件信息泄露漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows 8.1及更早版本中的Microsoft.XMLDOM ActiveX控件存在信息泄露漏洞。远程攻击者可通过构造特制的res://协议URL，利用该控件处理资源标识符时返回的不同错误码，探测目标系统上本地路径、UNC共享路径、内网主机名及内网IP地址等敏感信息的存在性。该漏洞在2014年2月已被检测到在野利用，CVSS评分6.5，危害等级中危。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，但仅能获取信息存在性判断，无法直接读取文件内容。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2013-7331"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2014-02-26T14:55:08Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:01:46Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2014 年 3 月安全公告 MS14-012 提供的 Internet Explorer 累积安全更新 (KB2925418)，该更新修复了 Microsoft.XMLDOM ActiveX 控件的信息泄露漏洞。可通过 Windows Update 自动获取更新，或从 Microsoft 下载中心手动下载安装。受影响系统包括 Windows XP 至 Windows 8.1 及对应 Server 版本上的 Internet Explorer 6 至 11。如无法立即安装更新，可配置 Internet Explorer 安全区域将 ActiveX 控件禁用或设置为提示，并避免在 IE 中打开不可信的 res:// 链接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.fireeye.com/blog/uncategorized/2014/02/operation-snowman-deputydog-actor-compromises-us-veterans-of-foreign-wars-website.html","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/539289","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1030818","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2014/ms14-052","https://soroush.secproject.com/blog/2013/04/microsoft-xmldom-in-ie-can-divulge-information-of-local-drivenetwork-in-error-messages/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2013-7331","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2013/CVE-2013-7331.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2013/7xxx/CVE-2013-7331.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2013/CVE-2013-7331","https://github.com/OlivierLaflamme/Cheatsheet-God/blob/b879fd62eaae297b38087b8227dde5f8f0cf7668/Cheatsheet_Windows.txt","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/4d0f24b3edae0bdb5391177851bad3be54ecea0f/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2013-7331.html","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2013-7331.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1decc7ade63192f9f527bfb87145d1636c01cc59/CVE/data/2013/CVE-2013-7331.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2013/CVE-2013-7331.md","https://github.com/lucacapacci/cisa_kev/blob/d206e936b7c9c49da608b2e68f805e3421c7432a/data_single/2013/CVE-2013-7331.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2013/POC-AVE-2013-0555.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2013/EXP-AVE-2013-0555.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2013/AVE-2013-0555.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2013-0016","file_name":"2013/AVE-2013-0016.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2013-7240","title":"WordPress Advanced Dewplayer 插件目录遍历漏洞","description":"Advanced Dewplayer 1.2 WordPress 插件中的 download-file.php 脚本存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 dew_file 参数传递包含 `..`（点点）序列的恶意路径，绕过访问限制读取服务器上任意文件，从而导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞危害等级中危，影响 WordPress Advanced Dewplayer 插件的 1.2 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，影响系统机密性。建议用户及时升级或移除受影响插件。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2013-7240"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2014-01-03T18:54:09Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:01:34Z","remediation":"立即将 Advanced Dewplayer 插件升级至 1.3 或更高版本（该版本已修复目录遍历问题，仅允许下载 .mp3 音频文件）。由于该插件已于 2025 年 3 月因安全问题被 WordPress 官方下架，建议彻底移除该插件并替换为其他受支持的音频播放器插件。如无法立即移除，可在 Web 服务器（Apache/Nginx）配置中对 download-file.php 路径添加访问控制规则，禁止直接访问该脚本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://seclists.org/oss-sec/2013/q4/566","http://seclists.org/oss-sec/2013/q4/570","http://wordpress.org/support/topic/security-vulnerability-cve-2013-7240-directory-traversal","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/64587","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/38936","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2013/CVE-2013-7240.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2013/CVE-2013-7240.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/efa56541ba84ae91eb0da267c473426b115491e2/http/cves/2013/CVE-2013-7240.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2013-7240.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2013-7240.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2013-7240-2289.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2013-7240-2290.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2013-7240-2287.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2013-7240-2286.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/CVE-2013-7240.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2013/CVE-2013-7240/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2013-7240.py"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2013/AVE-2013-0016.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2013-0015","file_name":"2013/AVE-2013-0015.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2013-7091","title":"Zimbra Collaboration Server 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Zimbra Collaboration Server 7.2.2 及 8.0.2 版本中存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 /res/I18nMsg,AjxMsg,ZMsg,ZmMsg,AjxKeys,ZmKeys,ZdMsg,Ajx%20TemplateMsg.js.zgz 发送特制请求，在 skin 参数中注入 ../ 序列读取服务器任意文件。攻击者可利用该漏洞获取 LDAP 凭据，进而通过 service/admin/soap API 创建管理员认证令牌，最终实现远程代码执行。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2013-7091"],"sources":["cve","exploitdb"],"published":"2013-12-14T00:00:00Z","updated":"2013-12-14T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 Zimbra Collaboration Server 至已修复该漏洞的版本，在反向代理或 WAF 层过滤 skin 参数中的目录遍历字符序列（如 ../），限制对 /res/ 路径的未授权访问，并将 LDAP 管理端口（7071）限制为仅内网可访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2013-7091","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/30472","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/30085","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/64149","http://osvdb.org/100747","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/89527","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/124321"],"poc_urls":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/30085"],"exp_urls":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/30472"],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2013/AVE-2013-0015.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2013-0406","file_name":"2013/AVE-2013-0406.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2013-3900","title":"Microsoft Windows WinVerifyTrust 签名验证远程代码执行漏洞","description":"WinVerifyTrust 函数在处理 Windows Authenticode 签名验证时存在安全功能绕过漏洞。该漏洞源于系统对可移植可执行文件（PE）的数字签名验证不充分，攻击者可通过修改已签名的可执行文件，在保留原有有效签名的情况下向文件中注入恶意代码。攻击条件要求用户或应用程序运行攻击者特制的带签名 PE 文件，成功利用后可导致任意代码执行，攻击者能够安装程序、查看/更改/删除数据或创建具有完全用户权限的新账户。该漏洞影响所有 Windows 10/11 及 Windows Server 版本，Microsoft 未默认启用严格验证，需通过注册表 EnableCertPaddingCheck 键值手动开启修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2013-3900"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2013-12-11T00:55:03Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:55:59Z","remediation":"通过注册表启用证书填充检查（EnableCertPaddingCheck）缓解此漏洞：在 HKLM\\Software\\Microsoft\\Cryptography\\Wintrust\\Config 下创建 DWORD 值 EnableCertPaddingCheck 并设为 1。该配置适用于 Windows 10/11 及 Windows Server 2016/2019/2022 等所有受支持版本，无需安装额外安全更新。设置后重启系统使配置生效。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2013-3900","http://blogs.technet.com/b/srd/archive/2013/12/10/ms13-098-update-to-enhance-the-security-of-authenticode.aspx","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2013/ms13-098","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2013-3900","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2013/CVE-2013-3900.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/3c5116308718006831f8b0ac674f891f3d553471/2013/CVE-2013-3900.json","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/851e1d65e286254517d0046580bf35d3fb74f349/data/2013/CVE-2013-3900-Sabecomoeh_CVE-2013-3900.md","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/dc4a87067238e8e55e5d3f9777b54558310f6d6e/2013/CVE-2013-3900/README.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2013/CVE-2013-3900","https://github.com/jekil/awesome-hacking/blob/3cb71ba9ab1ba31737dfbde9d3f1bba6c10627ba/_pages/index.rst","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2013/3xxx/CVE-2013-3900.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/S/smb_nt_ms22_oct_CVE-2013-3900_reg_check.nasl","https://github.com/alexander-morrison/Vulnerability_Management_Program/blob/7812f496985e5085eb2c82770223f89da8b32a65/automation/cve-2013-3900-mitigation.ps1","https://github.com/JayRHa/EndpointAnalyticsRemediationScripts/blob/224d9be8a91fcfee8884cd4fb0e0ab0ff1b77123/Enable-SignatureValidation/remediation_Remediate_Signature_Validation.ps1","https://github.com/norvethil/CVE-2013-3900-PowerShell-PoC","https://github.com/CyberCondor/Fix-WinVerifyTrustSignatureValidationVuln","https://github.com/OtisSymbos/CVE-2013-3900-WinTrustVerify","https://github.com/snoopopsec/vulnerability-CVE-2013-3900","https://github.com/Sabecomoeh/CVE-2013-3900"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2013/AVE-2013-0406.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2013-0508","file_name":"2013/AVE-2013-0508.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2013-5065","title":"Microsoft Windows Kernel NDProxy.sys 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows 内核的 NDProxy.sys 驱动程序中存在本地权限提升漏洞。该漏洞源于 NDProxy.sys 对用户态传入的 IOCTL 请求处理不当，导致未正确验证输入参数，本地攻击者可通过构造特制的应用程序向受影响系统发送恶意 IOCTL 调用，从而触发内核态任意内存写入，实现权限提升至 SYSTEM 级别。该漏洞影响 Windows XP SP2/SP3 及 Windows Server 2003 SP2 版本，已在 2013 年 11 月被检测到在野利用。Microsoft 在 MS14-002 安全公告中修复了此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2013-5065"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2013-11-28T00:55:04Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:58:19Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS14-002 提供的更新 KB2914368。Windows XP SP3 用户可通过 Windows Update 自动获取或手动下载安装；Windows Server 2003 SP2 用户同样适用。如无法立即打补丁，可临时将 NDProxy.sys 重定向至 Null.sys：以管理员身份运行命令 `sc stop ndproxy` 后执行 `reg add HKLM\\System\\CurrentControlSet\\Services\\ndproxy /v ImagePath /t REG_EXPAND_SZ /d system32\\drivers\\null.sys /f`，重启系统生效。注意该缓解措施会导致 TAPI 相关服务（远程访问、拨号网络、VPN）不可用，打补丁后须撤销此修改。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://technet.microsoft.com/security/advisory/2914486","http://www.fireeye.com/blog/technical/cyber-exploits/2013/11/ms-windows-local-privilege-escalation-zero-day-in-the-wild.html","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2014/ms14-002","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/37732/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2013-5065","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/37732","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2013/CVE-2013-5065.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/3c5116308718006831f8b0ac674f891f3d553471/2013/CVE-2013-5065.json","https://github.com/Al1ex/WindowsElevation/blob/e8fa2760f0ea29d1cdc759c623021d5ab7b715e2/CVE-2013-5065/CVE-2013-5065.py","https://github.com/Ascotbe/Kernelhub/blob/e55eb366bab445539ff16c63d3831ed4af91c92f/Windows/TestFailure/CVE-2013-5065/README.md","https://github.com/Heptagrams/Heptagram/blob/a4ce8d69730bc2ce39a88950a3c7c3c7805aee81/Windows/Elevation/MS14-002/CVE-2013-5065.c","https://github.com/hermit-hacker/OSCP-Study-Notes/blob/6c2587a4c4df26b2e9ad7b43ef299908055e5313/PrivEsc/Windows/CVE-2013-5065-MS14-02.exe","https://github.com/abatchy17/WindowsExploits/blob/5e9c25cda54fe33fb6e1fd3ae60512a1113b41df/MS14-002/30014.py","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2013/CVE-2013-5065","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2013/5xxx/CVE-2013-5065.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/d8c79a157e22e9abda84461cbe0f59ce58612245/references/CVE-2013-5065-2023-09-21-1730_1","https://github.com/Friarfukd/RobbinHood"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2013/AVE-2013-0508.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2013-0520","file_name":"2013/AVE-2013-0520.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2013-6282","title":"Linux Kernel ARM 平台 get_user/put_user 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 3.5.5 之前版本在 ARM v6k 和 v7 架构平台上，get_user 和 put_user API 函数未能正确验证用户空间传入的内存地址，导致本地攻击者可通过精心构造的应用程序读取或修改任意内核内存内容。该漏洞在 2013 年 10 月至 11 月期间已被广泛利用于针对 Android 设备的实际攻击中，攻击者利用此漏洞可实现本地权限提升，获取系统最高控制权。影响范围涵盖运行旧版 Linux 内核的 ARM 架构 Android 设备及嵌入式系统，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2013-6282"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2013-11-20T13:19:43Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:00:14Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 3.5.5 及以上版本，该版本合入了 commit 8404663f81d2 修复了 ARM v6k/v7 平台 get_user/put_user 未验证地址的问题。Android 设备用户请联系设备厂商获取对应安全补丁，或刷入已包含该修复的定制内核。如无法立即升级，可通过限制非授权应用安装、启用 SELinux 等缓解措施降低风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://git.kernel.org/?p=linux/kernel/git/torvalds/linux-2.6.git%3Ba=commit%3Bh=8404663f81d212918ff85f493649a7991209fa04","http://www.codeaurora.org/projects/security-advisories/missing-access-checks-putusergetuser-kernel-api-cve-2013-6282","http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/ChangeLog-3.5.5","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2013/11/14/11","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/63734","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-2067-1","https://github.com/torvalds/linux/commit/8404663f81d212918ff85f493649a7991209fa04","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/40975/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2013-6282","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/31574","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2013/CVE-2013-6282.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/3c5116308718006831f8b0ac674f891f3d553471/2013/CVE-2013-6282.json","https://github.com/tangsilian/android-vuln/blob/d472b6ca2f4c188ee4b7665f3c07461e60cbdf7f/CVE-2013-6282/Readme.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2013/CVE-2013-6282","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2013/6xxx/CVE-2013-6282.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/d8c79a157e22e9abda84461cbe0f59ce58612245/references/CVE-2013-6282-2023-09-21-1730","https://github.com/sundaysec/Android-Exploits/blob/2736ece957f9174ba2f063ed34d66f8f58f65e95/local/40975.rb","https://github.com/killvxk/thg-framework/blob/fab929cd77c91373ebc4212bd4e5891b54f0fb1b/data/source/exploits/CVE-2013-6282/Makefile","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2013/CVE-2013-6282/README_KO.md","https://github.com/vulncheck-oss/0day.today.archive/blob/3664abdd71985a44aff3260896a8f36e2f4a9682/local-exploits/26583.txt","https://github.com/fi01/libput_user_exploit","https://github.com/timwr/CVE-2013-6282","https://github.com/jeboo/bypasslkm","https://github.com/fi01/libget_user_exploit"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2013/AVE-2013-0520.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2013-0509","file_name":"2013/AVE-2013-0509.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2013-5223","title":"D-Link DSL-2760U 网关多参数跨站点脚本漏洞","description":"D-Link DSL-2760U 网关（Rev. E1）固件中存在多处跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。由于 sntpcfg.cgi、ddnsmngr.cmd、todmngr.tod、urlfilter.cmd、scprttrg.cmd、scoutflt.cmd、portmapcfg.cmd、snmpconfig.cgi、scinflt.cmd、prmngr.cmd、ippcfg.cmd、samba.cgi、wlcfg.wl 等多个 CGI 脚本对用户输入参数（如 ntpServer1、username、wlSsid 等 16 个参数）缺乏充分的过滤与转义，远程认证用户可通过向这些参数注入恶意脚本代码，在受害者浏览器中执行任意 HTML 或 JavaScript，导致敏感信息泄露或会话劫持。攻击者需拥有路由器管理面板的合法凭据，并诱使管理员访问特制链接。该漏洞影响 D-Link DSL-2760U Rev. E1 版本，CVSS 评分 5.4，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.4,"aliases":["CVE-2013-5223"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2013-11-19T04:50:12Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:58:32Z","remediation":"将 DSL-2760U 固件升级至 v1.12 或更高版本。登录设备 Web 管理界面，进入 Maintanence → System → Upgrade Firmware 上传固件更新。如设备已停止支持无法获取官方固件，建议禁用远程管理功能（默认关闭），限制管理界面仅内网访问，并避免在已登录管理会话的情况下点击不明链接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://osvdb.org/99603","http://osvdb.org/99604","http://osvdb.org/99605","http://osvdb.org/99606","http://osvdb.org/99607","http://osvdb.org/99608","http://osvdb.org/99609","http://osvdb.org/99610","http://osvdb.org/99611","http://osvdb.org/99612","http://osvdb.org/99613","http://osvdb.org/99615","http://osvdb.org/99616","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/123976","http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2013/Nov/76","http://securityadvisories.dlink.com/security/publication.aspx?name=SAP10002","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/88723","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/88724","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2013-5223","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/36988","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2013/CVE-2013-5223.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2013/5xxx/CVE-2013-5223.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2013/CVE-2013-5223","https://github.com/vulncheck-oss/0day.today.archive/blob/3664abdd71985a44aff3260896a8f36e2f4a9682/web-applications/21502.txt","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2013-5223.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2013-5223.html","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1decc7ade63192f9f527bfb87145d1636c01cc59/SSVC/data/2013/CVE-2013-5223.json","https://github.com/Ostorlab/KEV/blob/8feadeb8b7ff54359eab87941769781629146b23/README.md","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2013.txt","https://github.com/KaweGG/vulnerability_tracker/blob/01de5763b71f6c005791d4aa8121132990782604/cves/CVE-2013-5223.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2013/AVE-2013-0509.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2013-0409","file_name":"2013/AVE-2013-0409.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2013-3918","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer InformationCardSigninHelper ActiveX 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows 中 icardie.dll 的 InformationCardSigninHelper Class ActiveX 控件存在越界写入漏洞。远程攻击者可诱导用户通过 Internet Explorer 访问特制网页触发该漏洞，成功利用可在目标系统上执行任意代码或造成拒绝服务。该漏洞已在 2013 年 11 月被野外利用，影响 Windows XP SP2/SP3、Windows Server 2003 SP2、Windows Vista SP2、Windows Server 2008 SP2/R2 SP1、Windows 7 SP1、Windows 8/8.1、Windows Server 2012 Gold/R2 及 Windows RT Gold/8.1 等多个版本。攻击无需身份认证但需用户交互（点击链接），CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高危。Microsoft 已于 MS13-090 安全公告中发布修复补丁。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2013-3918"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2013-11-12T14:35:11Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:56:01Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS13-090 对应更新（KB2909921），该补丁修复了 icardie.dll 中 InformationCardSigninHelper ActiveX 控件的越界写入漏洞。如无法安装补丁，可通过注册表禁用该控件：regsvr32 /u %SystemRoot%\\System32\\icardie.dll，或设置 Internet Explorer 增强安全配置（ESC）阻止 ActiveX 自动运行。同时建议升级至不再受支持的 Windows/IE 版本（如 Windows 10 + IE11 以上），以规避该过时控件的风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://blogs.technet.com/b/msrc/archive/2013/11/11/activex-control-issue-being-addressed-in-update-tuesday.aspx","http://www.darkreading.com/vulnerability/new-ie-vulnerability-found-in-the-wild-s/240163814/","http://www.fireeye.com/blog/technical/2013/11/new-ie-zero-day-found-in-watering-hole-attack.html","http://www.us-cert.gov/ncas/alerts/TA13-317A","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2013/ms13-090","https://isc.sans.edu/forums/diary/16985","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A19089","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2013-3918","https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/msrc/blog/2013/11/technical-details-of-the-targeted-attack-using-ie-vulnerability-cve-2013-3918/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/29857","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2013/CVE-2013-3918.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2013/3xxx/CVE-2013-3918.json","https://github.com/OlivierLaflamme/Cheatsheet-God/blob/b879fd62eaae297b38087b8227dde5f8f0cf7668/Cheatsheet_Windows.txt","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2013/3xxx/CVE-2013-3918.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2013/CVE-2013-3918/README.md","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/4d0f24b3edae0bdb5391177851bad3be54ecea0f/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2013-3918.html","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2013-3918.txt","https://github.com/EmergingThreats/shrike/blob/1becbaf9b518f780cca746c56d6e153e8505fc68/packs.txt","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/c6c9e305761264e104c5de70e59376c519bbfef3/2013/CVE-2013-3918.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2013/POC-AVE-2013-0409.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2013/EXP-AVE-2013-0409.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2013/AVE-2013-0409.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2013-0408","file_name":"2013/AVE-2013-0408.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2013-3906","title":"Microsoft Office GDI+ TIFF图像处理远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft GDI+ 组件在处理特制 TIFF 图像文件时存在整数溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过诱导用户打开包含恶意 TIFF 图像的 Word 文档或其他 Office 文件触发该漏洞，导致远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 Windows Vista SP2、Windows Server 2008 SP2、Office 2003/2007/2010 及 Lync 2010/2013 等多个 Microsoft 产品，已在 2013 年 10 月至 11 月期间被野外利用。攻击者无需身份认证，仅需用户交互（如打开文档或预览邮件）即可完成利用，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2013-3906"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2013-11-06T15:55:05Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:55:59Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS13-096 (KB2908005) 提供的更新：Windows Vista/Server 2008 安装 KB2901674，Office 2003 安装 KB2850047，Office 2007 安装 KB2817641，Office 2010 安装 KB2817670，Lync 2010 安装 KB2899397，Lync 2013 安装 KB2850057。如无法立即打补丁，可通过注册表将 `HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\Gdiplus` 下的 `DisableTIFFCodec` DWORD 值设为 1 以禁用 TIFF 编解码器，阻止通过特制 TIFF 图片触发的攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://blogs.mcafee.com/mcafee-labs/mcafee-labs-detects-zero-day-exploit-targeting-microsoft-office-2","http://blogs.technet.com/b/srd/archive/2013/11/05/cve-2013-3906-a-graphics-vulnerability-exploited-through-word-documents.aspx","http://technet.microsoft.com/security/advisory/2896666","http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/30011","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2013/ms13-096","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2013-3906","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/30011","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2013/CVE-2013-3906.md","https://github.com/eyalmazuz/ThreatIntelligenceCorpus/blob/c47f9d2b7ba92e0cbba71c67b938a49e055c5cdc/Corpus/securityaffairs_microsoft-cve-2013-3906-zero-day.html.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2013/CVE-2013-3906.json","https://github.com/decalage2/oletools/blob/ec10260989dbc48b9109e3d05d22beee19cf2333/oletools/common/clsid.py","https://github.com/houjingyi233/office-exploit-case-study/blob/09de49e31b83b4348c9e892bfde1ef1f597bc38a/README.md","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2013-3906.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2013-3906.html","https://github.com/RedDrip7/APT_Digital_Weapon/blob/cc4cde356dcb4455419d80aedc3bba471249f167/PatchWork/PatchWork_hash.md","https://github.com/cwbae10-purdue/CTI-EACL24/blob/5990586483b6ba4c7e6eef0ddb1c3698a740308b/threat-reports-large/kaspersky/data/the-rush-for-cve-2013-3906-a-hot-commodity.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2013-3906.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2013/POC-AVE-2013-0408.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2013/EXP-AVE-2013-0408.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2013/AVE-2013-0408.toml"}]